<title>DUBAI: Caltex keeps Bahrain gas oil, changes jet prices.</title>
<headline>Caltex keeps Bahrain gas oil, changes jet prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caltex said on Monday it has kept its posted prices for gas oil ex-Bahrain unchanged at 64 cents a gallon for 0.5 percent sulphur and 63 cents a gallon for the one percent grade.</p>
<p>It cut both Jet A-1 fuel and dual purpose kerosene by 1 cent to 64 cents each a gallon.</p>
<p>Heavy fuel oil (380 cst) was cut to $14.77 a barrel from 14.87, the company said in a price list effective June 2.</p>
</text>
